    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my knee is killing me today. the osteoarthritis is acting up really bad and i can't even walk right. i have some ibuprofen in my cabinet, is it okay if i take a few of those to help with the swelling? i'm currently on eliquis for my afib so just wanted to check first.",
